---
title: "confirm_request (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_balance: assert spent_balance.is_none()
    q_check_balance --> q_abort_balance: spent_balance is some
    q_abort_balance --> [*]: abort ECantConsumeBalance
    q_check_balance --> q_check_action: no spent_balance
    q_check_action --> q_abort_action: action not in policy.rules
    q_abort_action --> [*]: abort EUnknownAction
    q_check_action --> q_destruct: action allowed
    q_destruct --> q_loop: iterate over required rules
    q_loop --> q_check_approval: for each rule_type
    q_check_approval --> q_abort_approval: rule not in approvals
    q_abort_approval --> [*]: abort ENotApproved
    q_check_approval --> q_loop: rule approved
    q_loop --> [*]: return (name, amount, sender, recipient)

    note right of q_check_action
        INV-001: all rules in policy must have matching approvals
        INV-002: spent_balance must be none (use confirm_request_mut for spend)
        INV-003: action must be registered in TokenPolicy.rules
    end note
